# Licensing — Framerate.cl

The Framerate.cl source code is made available so anyone can read it,
study how the platform works, run it for non-commercial purposes, and
contribute back. **Operating it commercially** — selling access, running
it as a paid service, monetizing the curated catalog, or launching a
competing offering — **requires written permission** from the copyright
holder.

The Framerate name, the framerate.cl domain, the logo, the color
palette, and the visual design are **not** licensed under any of the
terms below. They remain the property of the copyright holder.

Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Valentin Marquez. All rights reserved except as
expressly granted below.

